_ohc=-6Kit5p5TVQQ7kNvwGxpeZx&_nc_oc=Adny96MmSLcx3lTRN5ZFKZcDu_XkCF2SKNGf1PB-mm45oEWDx4h9ajIUP7xO1eilLfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuNB4R5ZQ3q0TK7gb6XqXfQ4EFPEbrSO6fo9R8cxsf2Hw&oe=69A0279C"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5.png", "id": "1142273521307880", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1142273524641213_8177972829284701471_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SjCqVMmqf1MQ7kNvwGxlPqQ&_nc_oc=AdlFJztdpGr7NV0ELZz6f4wm6oIq3BhQZjpumKiIP0h2LXYnK0BZVPpmK6xqAeiqTXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftVcBC9OlDce05cz0X9-SlYECgqYBNE8sDTL_0KpycKeg&oe=69A04114"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "NHLSA26 Cover 2560x1440.png", "id": "1334338518333907", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1334338525000573_6826442813457927854_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_aid=0&_nc_ohc=r3dPTcxxVnEQ7kNvwE9kmpJ&_nc_oc=AdkA2ntQtGi52gVBsrQeSutTaF07QZREMCAODeuhdPy5Z5_k2U2MDFR9DHwHMfZNm34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft-hrbAYvXDM6p9JfZXWOg4iX-o3ULxxnFj61WvdzUbKw&oe=69A057B9"}, "display_name": "NHL SENSE ARENA 26 VR Hockey", "keywords": ["Hockey", "NHL", "Sport", "Fitness", "Dangle"], "long_description": "# NHL\u00ae Sense Arena 26\u2122\n\n**Off-Ice Hockey Training & VR Hockey Game**\n\nStep into the future of **VR hockey** with **NHL Sense Arena 26\u2122 + DanglePro**, the **ONLY VR hockey training platform officially licensed by the NHL\u00ae**. Built for players and goalies at every level, it\u2019s the most advanced off-ice hockey training system ever built, designed to sharpen **hockey IQ, reaction time, hand-speed, and decision-making** from home.\n\n# PLANS:\n**UNLIMITED ACCESS**\n\n - Annual: $25/mo\n\n - Monthly: $59/mo\n\n**3V3 NHL GAMES ONLY**\n\n - SA26 Game: $39.99 (one-time)\n\n{806715751965892}\n\n# NEW IN NHL SENSE ARENA 26\u2122\n- **Updated 2025\u201326 NHL Season Mode** \u2013 NHL teams, dream roster management, NHL player likenesses, and collectible player profiles\n\n- **NHL Player Integration** \u2013 train in VR with real NHL players\n\n- **New Goalie Game Flow shooters** \u2013 shots from BU, UConn, NTDP, Little Caesar\u2019s, and Avalanche clubs\n\n- **Updated DanglePro drills** \u2013 new obstacles, competitions, and mixed-reality stickhandling challenges\n\n\n# TRAINING MODES\n# 100+ VR hockey drills\n- Built for both players & goalies to build hockey IQ for all skill levels and ages (10+)\n- **Guided insights and drills in P.A.S. & G.A.P. training programs** for progressive development\n\n{1513976172936551}\n# Game Flow for Goalies\n- Build focus and stamina with uninterrupted shots from AI-assisted passes\n- Three full periods of shots\n- Real shooters\n\n{798399323008866}\n\n# DanglePro stickhandling training\n- The most advanced stickhandling training tool\n- Real puck, real space, virtual obstacles in mixed-reality\n\n{1598969207760139}\n\n# **Train Smarter. Play Faster. Think the Game Better. With NHL Sense Arena 26\u2122.**", "short_description": "NHL Sense Arena 26 VR Hockey  \u2013 The Off-Ice VR Hockey Training  & VR NHL Games\n\nStep into the future of VR hockey with NHL Sense Arena 26  + DanglePro, the ONLY VR hockey training platform officially licensed by the NHL\u00ae. Built for players and goalies at every level, it\u2019s the most advanced off-ice hockey training system ever built, designed to sharpen hockey IQ, reaction time, hand-speed, and decision-making.\n\n\ud83c\udfd2 Training + DanglePro $25/mo, Base Game $40. \nLevel up your hockey training in VR!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sensearena.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sensearena.com/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "Sense Arena LLC", "support_website_url": "https://hockey.sensearena.com/support", "website_url": "https://nhl.sensearena.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMF